  "title": "Servant Weapon Auto Prerequisite Fix",
  "generatedAt": "2026-07-27T00:00:00+08:00",
  "scope": [
    "Auto Battle detects requiresTargetStatus before casting configured attack skills.",
    "DK_SERVANT_W_PHANTOM (5204) and DK_SERVANT_W_DEMOL (5205) automatically insert DK_SERVANT_W_SIGN (5203) when the current target is unmarked.",
