    "New targets are checked independently and never inherit another target status.",
    "Automatic missing-status log spam is suppressed while manual casts retain the guidance message.",
    "Auto Battle reserves at least one servant weapon after Sign and avoids zero-servant Phantom casts.",
    "up_to resource preview now checks the configured minimum rather than the maximum amount.",
    "Servant Sign can affect Boss/MVP targets, matching the inspected rAthena Renewal behavior."
